name: ai-usage
about: How much of your Claude plan you've used (the 5-hour window and the week) in the bar, and when it resets; Super+Alt+u says more
kinds: bar key menu
vikix: 0.71.185
lisp: plugin.lisp
setup: setup
remove: remove
changes: sets Claude Code's status line (statusLine in ~/.claude/settings.json) to ai-usage-statusline, which notes the plan usage Claude Code gives it and shows it there too; a status line of your own keeps running through it, and remove puts it back
